&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around 4 days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does a Senior Post Producer do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll play a central role in delivering high-quality post-production projects across edit, grade, VFX, motion, and sound. As a Senior Post Producer you will bridge hands-on production and leadership, managing key projects, supporting producers, and maintaining strong relationships with clients, agencies, and creative partners. You’ll ensure projects run smoothly, budgets are met, and the creative standard remains high across everything that leaves the studio. You’ll be someone who thrives on collaboration, solves problems calmly under pressure, and takes pride in delivering work that looks, sounds, and feels exceptional. The ideal candidate will have experience working with a global technology brand or demonstrate a strong drive and ambition to contribute to a high-calibre account.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Lead multiple post-production projects from brief to final delivery, managing timelines, budgets and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Oversee offline, online, grade, VFX, motion graphics and audio, ensuring projects are delivered on time and to a high standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Own production workflows, tracking progress, risks and budgets and keeping the Executive Producer informed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Proactively identify and resolve challenges, balancing creative, technical and commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Manage global workflows across a centralised production hub and continuously improve ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Explore and implement AI and emerging technologies to improve efficiency, quality and output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clients &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Act as a senior point of contact for clients and agency partners throughout production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Lead client calls, reviews and presentations, building trusted relationships and managing expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with creatives, artists, technical teams and senior production leads to deliver high-quality work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Support and mentor junior and mid-level producers, sharing best practice and fostering a collaborative team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Commercial&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Own the studio QC process, ensuring work meets brand, technical and delivery standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Develop and implement robust QC workflows and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Prepare budgets and estimates, maintaining accurate financial tracking and identifying opportunities to improve efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Contribute to rate cards, templates and processes that strengthen production and commercial&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong post-production experience across broadcast, digital and social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Senior-level experience managing complex, high-end campaigns from brief to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of the full post-production pipeline, including edit, colour, online, VFX and audio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple projects, priorities and stakeholders in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Excellent communicator, confident working with clients, agency partners and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience managing international clients and senior stakeholders across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Calm, organised and solutions-focused, with the ability to stay composed under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Collaborative team player who leads by example and supports the development of others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Passionate about craft, creativity, technology and innovation, with a strong eye for detail and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Genuine interest in technology brands and the wider tech landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Flexible and adaptable when project deadlines require occasional evening or weekend support. We value work-life balance and these instances are infrequent, with time off in lieu provided where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;#LI-LS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please contact &lt;a ----- ----- if you need the job advert or form in another format.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tavily, part of Nebius, is the web access layer for AI agents. Over two million developers use us, and our customers include Fortune 500 companies running agents in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vertical search is where we combine public sources with premium vertical data and shape the result into a product for a specific use case. This role owns that layer end to end. You decide which industries and use cases we productize. With the data team, you find and evaluate the public and premium data providers behind each one. You shape the product surface that sits on top.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will sit with customers in these industries, learn how they actually work, and turn their needs and pain points into clear specs. You will build with engineering, ship it, and make sure go-to-market knows how to sell it. You own the outcome, not just the handoff: from the first market call through to adoption and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hard part is choosing. There are more verticals worth building than we can build, and the difference between a good year and a wasted one is knowing which ones to invest in and which to walk away from, even when a large customer is asking for another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, we expect you to know our top use cases better than anyone here, ship a product built for one of them that customers will pay more for, and have a defensible view of what comes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on senior IC role with real ownership. You will work within a small PM team reporting to the Director of Product, alongside engineering, research, data, and go-to-market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the vertical roadmap. You decide where we invest, what we ship for each, and when a vertical is not worth it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the product surface on top of the data, so a customer gets something built for their job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find and evaluate the data behind each vertical, across public sources and paid providers, and decide what is worth investing in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit with customers in these industries until you understand their workflow, then turn that into specs engineering can build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set what a good answer looks like in each use case, working with our evaluation team, who own how we measure it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customer success to learn what customers ask us for and what makes them leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the search owner on how results should be ranked and shaped for each use case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with a meaningful portion in search, data, or industry-specific AI products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products for a specific industry or use case, combined with enough technical depth to work directly on the data underneath: where it comes from, how good it is, and what it takes to make it usable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of real customer discovery: you have gone deep on how a particular kind of team works, and shipped something because of what you found.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in API-first or developer-platform businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of LLMs, AI agents, and how search and retrieval systems fit into agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical background, through a degree in computer science or engineering or equivalent hands-on experience, with the ability to engage deeply with technical architecture and tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to influence and align cross-functional stakeholders without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain experience in market intelligence, news, financial research, or another data-heavy industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at a data provider, enrichment vendor, market intelligence platform, or vertical search company, or experience building vertical data products in-house.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating and working with external data providers, including judging quality and negotiating what you actually need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership experience in a high-growth technology company, especially post-acquisition or startup-within-a-larger-org environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Upsun (formerly Platform.sh)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsun is the cloud application platform humans and robots love. It is built for today’s hybrid teams, where AI agents write and test code and humans focus on solving the problems that really matter. Developers, DevOps engineers, and platform teams use Upsun to build, ship, and scale confidently without wrestling with backend infrastructure. We give you your time back. You get:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Predictable performance, even at scale &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Secure, compliant environments by default&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Real-time observability and profiling built in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cloning, configuration, and provisioning in seconds&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AI-ready features that plug directly into your stack &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The name says it all. &quot;Up&quot; means uptime, reliability, and acceleration. &quot;Sun&quot; reflects our follow-the-sun-support, a 24x7, globally distributed support team keeping the lights on while you rest. Our core belief is that software should power brighter solutions and greater innovation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsunners are a remote, global workforce, and we thrive in a multicultural team. We are committed to open source and an open, welcoming environment. Our team spans the globe and the experience spectrum. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s our commonality, our cultural fabric? A curious spirit and a thirst for knowledge; an eagerness for innovative ideas and cultures. We believe we can build anything together in an environment that frees you to do your best work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌿 We make a positive impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;✨ We aim for the stars.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💚 We care for each other.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact of a Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Product Manager at Upsun, you own a significant area of Upsun Cloud, our cloud application platform, and the outcomes it delivers for the developers who build on it. The team you join owns the platform&#39;s foundations: the API, the runtime, environments, and the reliability every application running on Upsun depends on. And because Upsun is the cloud application platform humans and robots love, much of what you build will be used by AI agents as much as by people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on, technically rich role that bridges product strategy and deep infrastructure understanding. You own the strategy and the roadmap for your area, working closely with engineering to define platform behavior, build scalable abstractions, and shape workflows that empower modern development teams. Throughout, you act as the key voice for the user, making sure everything we ship contributes meaningfully to an exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the strategy, roadmap, and priorities for your area of Upsun Cloud, balancing established foundations with uncharted territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem definition:&lt;/strong&gt; Synthesize inputs from customers, support, sales, and engineering into clear problem statements, constructively testing underlying assumptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution definition:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore options with your team, weigh trade-offs, and land on the right scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship small, iterate fast:&lt;/strong&gt; Release in increments and shorten the loop between shipping and learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with engineering (especially infrastructure and systems teams) to deliver platform capabilities that are reliable, scalable, and developer-friendly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for humans and agents:&lt;/strong&gt; Build with two audiences in mind—ensuring features, APIs, documentation, and error messages serve both people and AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer and data authority:&lt;/strong&gt; Connect with customers regularly, serve as an internal advocate for their needs, and define metrics that demonstrate value for users and the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence across teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Build alignment across engineering, design, Product Marketing, support, and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-market:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product Marketing early so go-to-market strategy helps shape the product, not just the launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product management experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in product management owning a distinct product area, ideally focused on developer platforms, PaaS, or cloud infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
