&lt;p&gt;The Company is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We highly value diversity at our company and encourage people of all different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives to apply. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By entering your email and phone number and submitting your application, you consent to receive emails, calls and SMS about your application and other roles at The Company, including by auto-dialer. Message and data rates may apply. Opt-out or text STOP to cancel at any time. If you are a California resident or reside outside the United States then by submitting your application you confirm that you have read, understood, agree and - where applicable - grant your prior, free, informed and express consent for the processing of your personal information, including sensitive personal information, as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://co.mindbodyonline.com/legal/california-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://co.mindbodyonline.com/legal/international-team-member-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;International Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(as applicable).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En bref&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Picnic, nous réinventons la façon dont les familles font leurs courses, grâce à un service innovant et durable disponible via une application. L’une des fonctionnalités préférées de nos clients est notre collection de recettes, qui nous permettent de proposer à nos clients des idées de repas savoureux et sains à préparer avec nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aujourd’hui, nous recherchons deux profils étudiants à mi-temps pour venir renforcer l’équipe, et nous aider &lt;strong&gt;sur la traduction et le suivi qualité de nos délicieuses recettes&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Que tu suives des études en business, marketing, nutrition, ou que tu sois simplement passionné·e par la cuisine, c’est une excellente opportunité pour découvrir les coulisses d’une startup en pleine croissance dans la foodtech. Ce que nous recherchons avant tout : une personne débrouillarde, avec un fort sens business, passionnée de cuisine et motivée pour apprendre !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le poste est à pourvoir au sein de l’équipe Meals à partir de&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;septembre, à raison de 16 heures par semaine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrichissement du catalogue: Tu contribues à élargir notre offre de recettes en traduisant celles proposées par notre équipe internationale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amélioration de nos recettes: Tu identifies les erreurs qui se cachent dans nos recettes et tu mets en place les améliorations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement de nos processus: À partir des erreurs identifiées, tu proposes des améliorations de nos processus de création ou de management de nos recettes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintien de la qualité de nos bases de données: nos recettes se basent sur des bases de données relationnelles. Améliorer une base de données bénéficie à toutes les recettes !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es actuellement en formation dans un domaine lié au commerce, marketing ou équivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu adores cuisiner pour toi ou tes proches, et tester les nouvelles tendances culinaires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es autonome, curieux·se et aimes apprendre sur le terrain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu aimes mettre en valeur tes créations et accordes une grande attention aux détails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises parfaitement le français et l’anglais à l’écrit comme à l’oral, pour échanger facilement avec tes collègues internationaux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Avantages Picnic&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍴 Restauration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comme nous sommes implantés au centre de Paris, pas de cantine sur place. Par contre, des tickets restaurant d’une valeur de 11€ par jour sont remis afin de tester tous les délicieux restaurants du coin. Notre petite cuisine est également équipée de savoureux en-cas et rafraîchissements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚲 Santé et transports&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grâce à nos partenariats avec Sidecare et OpenUp, tu as la possibilité de souscrire à notre mutuelle d’entreprise ainsi qu’à un accès facile et gratuit à des psychologues professionnels, des ateliers et des outils pratiques. De plus, si tu te rends au travail en transports en commun, nous te remboursons ton abonnement à hauteur de 50%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍️ Développement personnel et professionnel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu auras l’opportunité de développer tes compétences, non seulement au travers de projets stimulants, mais aussi grâce à un environnement dynamique, jeune et international.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎫Sorties et divertissement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Profite d&#39;un accès à des offres et avantages exclusifs via notre CSE et partenaire Swile (bons d&#39;achats, places de concert, cinéma, et plus encore). Tu profiteras aussi d&#39;inviations à tous nos événements récurrents comme notre très convoitée Summer Party !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Merci de soumettre votre candidature en anglais et de préparer un CV en anglais.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/IkZNKGYreOU&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ427R400&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As we continue our rapid expansion, we are seeking a dynamic, results-oriented Strategic Hunter Account Executive to join our team in France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;In this pivotal role, you will take ownership of some of France’s leading&amp;nbsp;accounts. This is a&amp;nbsp;high-visibility opportunity to deepen relationships, explore new business avenues, and deliver&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;transformative outcomes within the accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Reporting to our Director of Enterprise Sales, as a Strategic Hunter Account Executive at&amp;nbsp;Databricks, you will focus on identifying, engaging, and securing new opportunities within the&amp;nbsp;accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You are a true hunter — establishing executive-level connections, uncovering&amp;nbsp;untapped potential, and positioning Databricks as the premier platform for data, analytics, and&amp;nbsp;AI innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You will be leveraging your extensive hunting expertise, along with your solutions sales&amp;nbsp;experience in selling technical solutions in data/AI, advanced Analytics to inspire the client’s&amp;nbsp;vision and help shape how they leverage these technologies to drive business outcomes. Your&amp;nbsp;success will be measured by your ability to generate demand, close high-value deals, and&amp;nbsp;expand Databricks’ footprint within the accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you&#39;ll have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Leverage your expertise to identify new opportunities and&amp;nbsp;create use cases that demonstrate Databricks’ value and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Use your commercial network and strong relationship skills to broaden our presence&amp;nbsp;within complex organizations—engaging key decision-makers and trusted partners to drive growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Develop structured account plans that address your client’s business priorities and&amp;nbsp;position Databricks as a long-term digital transformation partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Draw on your experience selling cloud-based solutions to navigate enterprise cycles,&amp;nbsp;secure executive sponsorship, and deliver beyond customer expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Work closely with Databricks teams and selected partners to deliver tailored solutions that&amp;nbsp;meet the specific needs of the customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply your sales expertise to close sophisticated business and drive clear, measurable results within the accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Demonstrated passion and experience in selling complex, technical cloud solutions, with&amp;nbsp;the drive to understand and translate advanced technology into business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Extensive Hunting experience and understanding of the complexities and nuances of strategic accounts. A track record of selling into Large Enterprise accounts is&amp;nbsp;essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Proven hands-on experience working with open source technologies, and a strong&amp;nbsp;background in advising on build-versus-buy decisions for enterprise clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Proven track record in selling big data, AI/Analytics solutions, with&amp;nbsp;expertise navigating multi-stakeholder enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;An understanding of, or experienced in selling consumption model solutions is highly&amp;nbsp;desirable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience of applying value-based selling methodologies, consistently positioning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;technology solutions around measurable customer impact and ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Creative, resourceful sales professional with a structured and proactive prospecting&amp;nbsp;motion—capable of building a sustainable pipeline from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Consistently exceeded sales quotas, showing a results-driven approach and commitment&amp;nbsp;to surpassing ambitious targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Grit, resilience, and tenacity—excited by the challenge of opening greenfield accounts,&amp;nbsp;building new relationships, and driving growth in untapped territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Fluency in French and English is essential.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;📍London or UK remote | 💰 £100,000 to £130,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance +&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/#benefits&quot;&gt; Benefits &lt;/a&gt;|&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/technology&quot;&gt; Technology&lt;/a&gt; -&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/data&quot;&gt; Data&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1qv2ufb&quot; data-start=&quot;348&quot; data-end=&quot;373&quot;&gt;⭐ About Data at Monzo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;375&quot; data-end=&quot;632&quot;&gt;Data is at the heart of how we make decisions and build products at Monzo. Our Data teams bring together Data Science, Analytics Engineering, Data Analytics and Machine Learning, working closely with Product, Engineering and other teams across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;634&quot; data-end=&quot;928&quot;&gt;Our Data Scientists are embedded within product and business areas across Monzo, where they use experimentation, causal inference, statistical modelling, machine learning and analytics to understand our customers, identify opportunities and influence the direction of our products and strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;930&quot; data-end=&quot;1161&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;959&quot;&gt;Data Science Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll lead a team of Data Scientists and other Data professionals within one of these areas, combining people leadership with strategic data leadership and close partnership with senior stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1ylxzul&quot; data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;🔑 You&#39;ll play a key role by...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1372&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with Product, Engineering and senior leaders to ensure data plays a central role in how we understand problems, make decisions and develop our products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1731&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll lead and develop a team of talented Data Scientists, helping them do their best work while setting a high bar for analytical quality and impact. You&#39;ll provide strategic direction across complex problems, help teams identify where Data Science can have the greatest impact, and ensure insights translate into meaningful decisions and product changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1733&quot; data-end=&quot;2102&quot;&gt;We have a strong culture of data-driven decision making across Monzo. We&#39;re big believers in powerful, accessible analytics and empowering teams across the business to answer questions themselves. Around 90% of our day-to-day data-driven decisions are supported by self-serve analytics through Looker, giving our Data teams the space to focus on higher-impact problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;18uh40c&quot; data-start=&quot;2104&quot; data-end=&quot;2123&quot;&gt;Your day-to-day&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2125&quot; data-end=&quot;3199&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p4mj4y&quot; data-start=&quot;2125&quot; data-end=&quot;2217&quot;&gt;Lead, develop and grow a team of exceptional Data Scientists and other Data professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kl695j&quot; data-start=&quot;2218&quot; data-end=&quot;2335&quot;&gt;Hire, coach and retain talented people while creating an environment where they can develop and do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wu0fsg&quot; data-start=&quot;2336&quot; data-end=&quot;2458&quot;&gt;Set the Data Science direction for your area and identify where data can have the greatest customer and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ohaplb&quot; data-start=&quot;2459&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering and senior stakeholders to shape strategy and influence product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lt3n4x&quot; data-start=&quot;2570&quot; data-end=&quot;2692&quot;&gt;Bring analytical rigour to complex and ambiguous problems and help teams turn them into clear, actionable opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;62gosu&quot; data-start=&quot;2693&quot; data-end=&quot;2847&quot;&gt;Ensure teams are using the right analytical approaches, from experimentation and causal inference through to statistical modelling and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;spek0d&quot; data-start=&quot;2848&quot; data-end=&quot;2937&quot;&gt;Help connect Data Science work to measurable customer, product and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7im1pb&quot; data-start=&quot;2938&quot; data-end=&quot;3085&quot;&gt;Work with Analytics Engineering, Machine Learning and other Data disciplines to ensure teams have the data, tooling and infrastructure they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1302yjf&quot; data-start=&quot;3086&quot; data-end=&quot;3199&quot;&gt;Contribute to the wider Data Science discipline at Monzo, helping us continually raise the bar for how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;ycs329&quot; data-start=&quot;3201&quot; data-end=&quot;3240&quot;&gt;🤩 We&#39;d love to hear from you if...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3242&quot; data-end=&quot;4399&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;n0jdqo&quot; data-start=&quot;3242&quot; data-end=&quot;3282&quot;&gt;What we&#39;re doing at Monzo excites you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;aaanm1&quot; data-start=&quot;3283&quot; data-end=&quot;3357&quot;&gt;You have significant experience managing and developing Data Scientists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jatyaf&quot; data-start=&quot;3358&quot; data-end=&quot;3449&quot;&gt;You&#39;re a strong strategic data leader who uses data to influence decisions and direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ai3t3h&quot; data-start=&quot;3450&quot; data-end=&quot;3573&quot;&gt;You have experience partnering with senior and executive stakeholders across different functions and levels of seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qxq852&quot; data-start=&quot;3574&quot; data-end=&quot;3660&quot;&gt;You&#39;re comfortable working autonomously in a fast-growing and evolving organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vwfjmo&quot; data-start=&quot;3661&quot; data-end=&quot;3809&quot;&gt;You have a strong understanding of Data Science approaches including experimentation, causal inference, statistical analysis and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r6z2hr&quot; data-start=&quot;3810&quot; data-end=&quot;3953&quot;&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with tools and languages such as Python and SQL, and understand how to choose the right analytical approach for a problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1195ki8&quot; data-start=&quot;3954&quot; data-end=&quot;4079&quot;&gt;You can build credibility with Product, Engineering and senior business leaders and influence without relying on authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w97j5z&quot; data-start=&quot;4080&quot; data-end=&quot;4192&quot;&gt;You have strong product judgement and experience using Data Science to shape product development and strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nmurw1&quot; data-start=&quot;4193&quot; data-end=&quot;4291&quot;&gt;You know how to balance technical excellence with pragmatic decision-making and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qvls2w&quot; data-start=&quot;4292&quot; data-end=&quot;4399&quot;&gt;You have experience helping Data Scientists develop their technical, product and leadership capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;br6dct&quot; data-start=&quot;4401&quot; data-end=&quot;4426&quot;&gt;The interview process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4428&quot; data-end=&quot;4537&quot;&gt;Our interview process involves 3 main stages. We promise not to ask you any brain teasers or trick questions!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4539&quot; data-end=&quot;4657&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1o6cctv&quot; data-start=&quot;4539&quot; data-end=&quot;4565&quot;&gt;30-minute recruiter call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;todk6r&quot; data-start=&quot;4566&quot; data-end=&quot;4606&quot;&gt;45-minute call with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hpj58m&quot; data-start=&quot;4607&quot; data-end=&quot;4657&quot;&gt;3 x 1-hour video calls with various team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4659&quot; data-end=&quot;4844&quot;&gt;Our average process takes around 3–4 weeks, but we&#39;ll always work around your availability. You&#39;ll have the chance to speak to our recruitment team at various points during the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1p19p2y&quot; data-start=&quot;4846&quot; data-end=&quot;4870&quot;&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4872&quot; data-end=&quot;4909&quot;&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4911&quot; data-end=&quot;4933&quot;&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4935&quot; data-end=&quot;5067&quot;&gt;📍 This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK, with ad hoc meetings in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5069&quot; data-end=&quot;5196&quot;&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5198&quot; data-end=&quot;5277&quot;&gt;📚 Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;➕And much more, see our full list of benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
